#: kcm_krfb.cpp:67
msgid "Desktop Sharing Control Module"
msgstr "桌面分享控制模組"

#: kcm_krfb.cpp:69
msgid "Configure desktop sharing"
msgstr "設定桌面分享"

#: kcm_krfb.cpp:98
msgid "You have no open invitation."
msgstr "您沒有未處理的邀請。"

#: kcm_krfb.cpp:100
#, c-format
msgid "Open invitations: %1"
msgstr "未處理的邀請: %1"

#: kcm_krfb.cpp:176
msgid ""
"<h1>Desktop Sharing</h1> This module allows you to configure the KDE desktop "
"sharing."
msgstr "<h1>桌面分享</h1>這個模組讓您設定 KDE 桌面分享。"

#. i18n: file configurationwidget.ui line 37
#: rc.cpp:3
#, no-c-format
msgid "Acc&ess"
msgstr "存取(&E)"

#. i18n: file configurationwidget.ui line 54
#: rc.cpp:6
#, no-c-format
msgid "Invitations"
msgstr "邀請"

#. i18n: file configurationwidget.ui line 74
#: rc.cpp:9
#, no-c-format
msgid "You have no open invitations."
msgstr "您沒有未處理的邀請。"

#. i18n: file configurationwidget.ui line 90
#: rc.cpp:12
#, no-c-format
msgid "Create && &Manage Invitations..."
msgstr "建立及管理邀請(&M)..."

#. i18n: file configurationwidget.ui line 93
#: rc.cpp:15
#, no-c-format
msgid "Click to view or delete the open invitations."
msgstr "鍵入檢視或刪除未處理的邀請。"

#. i18n: file configurationwidget.ui line 111
#: rc.cpp:18
#, no-c-format
msgid "Uninvited Connections"
msgstr "未經邀請的連線"

#. i18n: file configurationwidget.ui line 128
#: rc.cpp:21
#, no-c-format
msgid "Allow &uninvited connections"
msgstr "容許未經邀請的連線(&U)"

#. i18n: file configurationwidget.ui line 134
#: rc.cpp:24
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select this option to allow connecting without inviting. This is useful if you "
"want to access your desktop remotely."
msgstr "開始此選項容許未經邀請的連線。當您要從遠端存取自己的桌面時很有用。"

#. i18n: file configurationwidget.ui line 142
#: rc.cpp:27
#, no-c-format
msgid "Announce service &on the network"
msgstr "在網絡上公佈服務(&O)"

#. i18n: file configurationwidget.ui line 148
#: rc.cpp:30
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you allow uninvited connections and enable this option, Desktop Sharing will "
"announce the service and your identity on the local network, so people can find "
"you and your computer."
msgstr "如您容許未經邀請的連線又開啟此選項，桌面分享會在區域網絡上公佈這在服務及您的識別資料，使別人能找到您的電腦。"

#. i18n: file configurationwidget.ui line 156
#: rc.cpp:33
#, no-c-format
msgid "Confirm uninvited connections &before accepting"
msgstr "在接受未經邀請的連線前要先確定(&B)"

#. i18n: file configurationwidget.ui line 159
#: rc.cpp:36
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If enabled, a dialog will appear when somebody attempts to connect, asking you "
"whether you want to accept the connection."
msgstr "如開啟此選項，當有人要連接時，會有對話盒詢問您是否接受連線。"

#. i18n: file configurationwidget.ui line 167
#: rc.cpp:39
#, no-c-format
msgid "A&llow uninvited connections to control the desktop"
msgstr "容許未經邀請的連線控制桌面(&L)"

#. i18n: file configurationwidget.ui line 170
#: rc.cpp:42
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enable this option to allow uninvited user to control your desktop (using mouse "
"and keyboard)."
msgstr "開啟此選項讓未經邀請的連線控制您的桌面（使用滑鼠和鍵盤）。"

#. i18n: file configurationwidget.ui line 216
#: rc.cpp:45
#, no-c-format
msgid "Pass&word:"
msgstr "密碼(&W):"

#. i18n: file configurationwidget.ui line 233
#: rc.cpp:48
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you allow uninvited connections, it is highly recommended to set a password "
"in order to protect your computer from unauthorized access."
msgstr "如您容許未經邀請的連線，強烈建議您設定密碼以保護您的電腦，不讓未經授權的人存取。"

#. i18n: file configurationwidget.ui line 264
#: rc.cpp:51
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Session"
msgstr "工作階段(&S)"

#. i18n: file configurationwidget.ui line 281
#: rc.cpp:54
#, no-c-format
msgid "Session Preferences"
msgstr "工作階段偏好設定"

#. i18n: file configurationwidget.ui line 298
#: rc.cpp:57
#, no-c-format
msgid "Always disable &background image"
msgstr "必定停用背景圖像(&B)"

#. i18n: file configurationwidget.ui line 304
#: rc.cpp:60
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check this option to always disable the background image during a remote "
"session. Otherwise the client decides whether the background will be enabled or "
"disabled."
msgstr "開啟此選項會令遠端連入時必定停用背景圖像。否則客戶端可決定是否開啟背景圖像。"

#. i18n: file configurationwidget.ui line 333
#: rc.cpp:63
#, no-c-format
msgid "&Network"
msgstr "網絡(&N)"

#. i18n: file configurationwidget.ui line 350
#: rc.cpp:66
#, no-c-format
msgid "Network Port"
msgstr "網絡通訊埠"

#. i18n: file configurationwidget.ui line 367
#: rc.cpp:69
#, no-c-format
msgid "Assi&gn port automatically"
msgstr "自動分派通訊埠(&G)"

#. i18n: file configurationwidget.ui line 373
#: rc.cpp:72
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Check this option to assign the network port automatically. This is recommended "
"unless your network setup requires you to use a fixed port, for example because "
"of a firewall."
msgstr "開啟此選項會自動分派通訊埠。除非您的網絡設置需要您使用固定通訊埠，例如因為使用防火牆，否則建議您使用此選項。"

#. i18n: file configurationwidget.ui line 404
#: rc.cpp:75
#, no-c-format
msgid "P&ort:"
msgstr "連接埠(&O):"

#. i18n: file configurationwidget.ui line 424
#: rc.cpp:78
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enter the TCP port number here"
msgstr "在此輸入 TCP 連接埠號碼"

#. i18n: file configurationwidget.ui line 428
#: rc.cpp:81
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Use this field to set a static port number for the desktop sharing service. "
"Note that if the port is already in use the Desktop Sharing service will not be "
"accessible until you free it. It is recommended to assign the port "
"automatically unless you know what you are doing.\n"
"Most VNC clients use a display number instead of the actual port. This display "
"number is the offset to port 5900, so port 5901 has the display number 1."
msgstr ""
"使用此欄位設定桌面分享服務使用的靜態連接埠號碼。若您的連接埠已被使用，桌面分享服務將無法使用，直至您釋放這個連接埠為止。除非您知道自己在做甚麼，否則建議您選擇自"
"動分派連接埠。\n"
"絕大部份 VNC 用戶端使用顯示號碼而非實際連接埠。這個顯示號碼是和 5900 相差的數目，所以連接埠5901 即是顯示號碼 1 。"
